  "source_name": "https://www.whattoexpect.com/getting-pregnant/having-a-second-child/back-to-back-babies.aspx",
  "source_type": "website",
  "structure": {
    "block_count": 38,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Two Under 2: Your Guide to Close-in-Age Siblings",
        "text_sha256": "3923ff498c97151bce72d5994a85f477ae982962456356e617d4c7902a76b9bb",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Updates to copy, sources, and formatting.",
        "text_sha256": "2bf448333081ffc8549a45a6c4b7fc711ee4b93575f0fffd3c4a6212c13581c2",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "toddler touching baby belly",
        "text_sha256": "e55f9ac2acf6f3d656d2732c0d33e56a56b51b42106edb1c7d97c24bac026bd6",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you're thinking about having another baby before your firstborn turns 2, here are a few things to consider.",
        "text_sha256": "274b85cf65cbd4af7582791636f523f0cb63ecdada8f20789550daa7d6193902",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Many parents find themselves so smitten with a first baby that they’re ready to repeat the experience immediately. Every adorable baby step into the second year makes them long to do infancy all over again and provide a playmate for their darling, who’s toddling headlong into the next stage.",
        "text_sha256": "e855de3f8b982e1308743cb8f89057cf9423d0b87299197241a36ee0b2e325a3",
        "word_count": 49
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you’re one of these parents, here's the deal on the real benefits of having back-to-back babies (i.e., fewer than 18 months apart), as well as a few challenges to keep in mind.",
        "text_sha256": "2fddf524f68206c26f316d5d70923cd254b4a5b1aa5d6e81ec28b38d80a785af",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Key Takeaways",
        "text_sha256": "cc3f7f0f4513969e418b56fb93ec0876fd96dd6498395b04301f70dbddff8a45",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "A small age gap has its plusses… With close-in-age babies, you’re already a pro at feedings, late nights, and diapering, plus your tots will play easily together (let’s hope!)",
        "text_sha256": "fef9737be05011ce9fcfc9d0f37871cb2e6d080179a1b1e2100ecbeaa1a65101",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "…but it’s also a ton of work. We’re not gonna lie — two under 2 means a tough schedule of constant child care, little down time for you, and possible sibling spats.",
        "text_sha256": "8ecda29d674ecbbcac306fe9f518c537c6978d39cb0efd9b37e42d5b2d5895cd",
        "word_count": 32
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Timing is up to you, but safety matters. Experts recommend at least 6 months between babies (18 months is ideal), but talk with your OB/GYN about what’s best for you.",
        "text_sha256": "628c67a4e73ec0819a622960aae829f377314279ca16cd471a29be9f0687996e",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Benefits of back-to-back babies",
        "text_sha256": "531ebea9d7374835387499ac711a599affcb3f629dfe10215e7043b3ecbf6f1a",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "You’re already so deep into the crazy-busy life of a new parent that you won’t undergo the shock of going from 0 to 60 like you did with your first.",
        "text_sha256": "2d854a2718e0654733bf501b1b3d669ad9b7f593bfd3e13d4904b3e379e93751",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "You’re already a pro at all things baby — from breastfeeding to soothing a tantrum away.",
        "text_sha256": "4184dfdbffdf2c2c6e164b59e154d5814a2e64a8fcdab373abdf71d25c2c40f7",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Your children are more likely to share the same interests and play well together.",
        "text_sha256": "10c96f469591178a16a69142e7aa511f7dee12b86077133c7f1f41a4912f140d",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "You already have a lot of baby gear ready to be reused.",
        "text_sha256": "4444f107856d68d3ee5cff2bd3f6ba7b99e87ffca73dfc2a82cb772130d1072a",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "You’ll get the chaos of the early years over in one fell swoop (unless, of course, you go on to baby three!).",
        "text_sha256": "675ab5edb9fc20bb665bea8ae7de1513eab0f8e54ebf0bafac760091f6dc54c6",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Your children will learn from each other and may become fast friends because they’re close playmates.",
        "text_sha256": "390b4076c8a0ea4e27605d0a675d969856307f755599380fd7c145e930ccaaca",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "You’re more likely to get pregnant now if you’re in your late 30s or beyond (and worried about fertility) than if you wait.",
        "text_sha256": "9f7a9ae7c44c59347c36950b15c1172f7f8bce18b47385c20406cb41dd5125c2",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Pulling double-diaper duty can be super efficient (and what could be cuter than two tots in a tub?).",
        "text_sha256": "b2f6245383049a17eea2dc6e57d00887db3a65003d9437c1039f06f02577f849",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you’re thinking about growing your family, download the What to Expect app for expert tips, trusted advice, and loads of support from others with “two under 2.”",
        "text_sha256": "3851aa15ee18ae9eab3c801f6fd283615182dbf8fec7355ab8c35ea530c8b372",
        "word_count": 28
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Drawbacks to back-to-back babies",
        "text_sha256": "b19a11a0785ac9f6d59126d21682bb52ac88c6e7180a568ee7f5156f6ce11d31",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "It’s physically taxing to care for two little ones, especially if you’re suffering from a sleep deficit.",
        "text_sha256": "099f91b2fb45bdbc0a4e3f857fd1745da4ec6e580d34bedf80be7b34cefda3a9",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Sibling squabbles tend to escalate when kids are close in age.",
        "text_sha256": "8debb6ccc57026351319326540307d8f27d86241f27dea16ff0bfd81c195ff83",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "You may need duplicates of big-ticket gear like strollers or cribs. Breastfeeding two can be challenging, if you intend to nurse into toddlerhood.",
        "text_sha256": "3cc5b722155e48ffd34005419e37207996f8b69bd3e8e956c1bb36ce162008d7",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "It can be doubly challenging to find time for yourself and your partner.",
        "text_sha256": "73cf458a79aa1a0c06d999cbb772fb5ef29a1d4ee283e9fe29cda8ec73b44417",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "You may feel you miss out on savoring certain milestones because your days have been a whirlwind.",
        "text_sha256": "44204561a6370f684a236339876ef791c1d330d4e471f2798f073c9dcba27f9d",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "You may have to make extra efforts to see your children as individuals as they grow older.",
        "text_sha256": "fbc951a511d376631f87f3af608d3ead0b5cfb239b8c294d1b2c7f44aac0cbd1",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Keep in mind that the American College of Obstetricians and Gynecologists (ACOG) recommends waiting at least 6 months and ideally 18 months after giving birth (especially if you've had a C-section) to reduce the risks of complications in your next pregnancy. Trusted SourceAmerican College of Obstetricians and GynecologistsOptimizing Postpartum CareSee All Sources [1] Too little time between pregnancies can increase the risk of preterm birth and low birthweight-babies, according to the March of Dimes. Trusted SourceMarch of DimesHow Long Should You Wait Before Getting Pregnant Again?See All Sources [2]",
        "text_sha256": "fe352bca1fb2e9838a4c12950f606bf3a72a7b2635efb3e24517f55d35527ce6",
        "word_count": 89
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
        "block_index": 28,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Trusted SourceAmerican College of Obstetricians and GynecologistsOptimizing Postpartum CareSee All Sources",
        "text_sha256": "67421f6115411ad79251c25103ea804820f5b1da05cfb8e959cd025e9aba1a45",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000029",
        "block_index": 29,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Trusted SourceMarch of DimesHow Long Should You Wait Before Getting Pregnant Again?See All Sources",
        "text_sha256": "a3d521b00e5a578046e43e1b0c7d8af8692df93d7debc8c0d45b990d85d82605",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000030",
        "block_index": 30,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "What to Expect Community parent samb11 had her second when her first was 20 months and offers some sound advice: “It'll be tough for both you and your older baby, so give yourself and her some grace. It does get easier after like 6 to 8 months. It’s just a short season when it’s tough, but you’ll get through it.”",
        "text_sha256": "4c1026a929bc44d7465a7123d5fb5657905a5a977ac9a94baafffb62d8a0af7e",
        "word_count": 60
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000031",
        "block_index": 31,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "How you choose to weigh these pros and cons is a completely personal decision, and you should speak with your OB/GYN about your unique circumstances and what would be safest for you. Considerations that might influence how you feel about these issues include:",
        "text_sha256": "89f9d4072674aa8ede1bb07cef21ab1ece2eebc643755df520489055244ccb44",
        "word_count": 43
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000032",
        "block_index": 32,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Your and your partner’s own birth orders",
        "text_sha256": "dbb8753e1c5b292cfa6f3e959163cb38a7f64003d24d6e2d087eaad42a47b480",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000033",
        "block_index": 33,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "The nature of your pregnancy and childbirth experience (Was it easy? Or were you left feeling a little battered?)",
        "text_sha256": "70da911a28cf84c5f4787f60385520a50963c549f4e6f2f9d5a6191210f718f0",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000034",
        "block_index": 34,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Your current finances and jobs",
        "text_sha256": "6e2c9597cb3f3abdc9857da1e29fb20880ab3d7640c3143da4ea7cb3286455a2",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000035",
        "block_index": 35,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "The availability of child care",
        "text_sha256": "3684a1aee2a244d7f0789750cb732e7734c953dc9d2e1375b0927dd05c783714",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000036",
        "block_index": 36,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Some parents choose to let the fates decide and allow back-to-back babies to happen … or not. And for others, well, accidents do happen.",
        "text_sha256": "5dd58340915beb40721ca75f041c0a7e84fc9fa52a23d2927a2d4d6a0014130e",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "But here’s the truth about spacing children : No matter how you time your second child, you’ll figure out how to make it work.",
        "text_sha256": "71d9c04be296dcf7fa58e1fd326ae81a8da10a685a6d772b7eb9c7a4d57b642a",
        "word_count": 24
      }
    ],
    "content_word_count": 798,
    "heading_count": 4
  },
  "title": "Two Under 2: Your Guide to Close-in-Age Siblings",
